      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is no *runtime* Unity API to add a component anywhere other than the end. Components can only be reordered in the editor.\n\nMy suggestion, if this is important, is for VRCSDK to permit world creators to add this component before upload, and to use GetOrAddComponent<OnAudioFilterRead>() at runtime to reuse the component in the order it was added.\n\nWhy does the order matter?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
